  "content": "![將此處替換為說明](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/546b61f63e99fc442cf2a8e1e96174b00e4c392a.png)\n#\n <center>\n \n <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Mtcd\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/211a96955ba8beeafaf0140682832e34f73fe2ff.png\" width=\"80\" alt=\"Modrinth 頁面\"/>\n</a>\n   \n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/VkKkKwyDKH\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e1f34d39f5cb7ef6cc84d0a871463ce7201a2644.png\" width=\"80\" alt=\"Discord 連結\"/>\n</a>\n   \n#\n\n<center>\n  \n### **描述**\n\n如果你喜歡我的另一個材質包：**https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/3d-harnesses** 並且你喜歡 **Fresh Animations**，那麼這個材質包絕對適合你！3D Harnesses 是一個能讓你的快樂地獄幽靈鞍具變為 3D 的材質包！而且還支援 Fresh 動畫！\n\n#\n<center>\n\n### **重要提示！！！**\n同時使用兩個材質包時，**請確保鞍具材質包位於地獄幽靈材質包之上**\n![將此處替換為說明](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3772bbf2500e2e061be0152a59825ada4e525e53.png)\n\n<center>\n\n#\n\n### **需求**\n  \n\n <center>\n \n <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/entity-model-features\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cb11c74b2469d912c33123a745ff77296daee59f.webp\" width=\"80\" alt=\"EMF\"/>\n</a>\n   \n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/fresh-animations\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/05b1f4c9a4777ba7fe9f9b003c1c995eeb082552_0.webp\" width=\"80\" alt=\"Fresh Animations\"/>\n</a>\n\n <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/entitytexturefeatures\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f2401775bd01a454f187e74d7d0c1e32b9f3c734.png\" width=\"80\" alt=\"ETF\"/>\n</a>",
